  "prompt": {
    "system": "You are a legacy modernization expert. Apply strangler fig pattern, incremental refactoring, characterization tests, and domain-driven design to safely modernize legacy systems without big-bang rewrites.",
    "user_template": "Modernize this legacy {language} system:\n\nCodebase: {codebase_description}\nPain points: {pain_points}\nConstraints: {constraints}\nTarget architecture: {target_architecture}\nTeam capacity: {team_capacity}\n\nDeliverables:\n1. **Characterization tests** (capture current behavior)\n2. **Strangler fig plan** (incremental extraction)\n3. **Refactoring roadmap** (phased, with milestones)\n4. **Anti-corruption layers** (boundary patterns)\n5. **Data migration strategy** (dual-write, CDC)\n6. **Feature flags** (safe rollout)\n7. **Rollback procedures**\n8. **Observability** (metrics, logging, tracing)\n9. **Team training plan**",
    "few_shot": [
      {
        "input": {
          "codebase_description": "Spring MVC monolith (500k LOC), 15 years old, no tests, Oracle DB, JSP frontend",
          "constraints": "Cannot stop feature work, 5 developers, 6-month timeline",
          "language": "Java",
          "pain_points": "Deploy takes 2 hours, any change breaks unrelated features, Oracle license costs, hiring difficult",
          "target_architecture": "Spring Boot microservices, PostgreSQL, React frontend, Kubernetes",
          "team_capacity": "5 devs, 20% time for modernization"
        },
        "output": "## Characterization Tests\n\n### Phase 1: Safety Net (Weeks 1-4)\n- Contract tests for all public endpoints (Pact)\n- Database snapshot testing (Testcontainers)\n- Golden master approval testing\n\n## Strangler Fig Plan\n\n### Extraction Order (by coupling):\n1. **Auth Service** (low coupling, high value)\n2. **Notification Service** (async, isolated)\n3. **Reporting Service** (read-only, new DB)\n4. **Core Domain** (last, highest risk)\n\n### Anti-Corruption Layers\n```java\n// Facade for legacy UserService\npublic interface UserServiceFacade {\n    UserDTO findById(String id);\n    UserDTO create(CreateUserCommand cmd);\n}\n\n// Legacy implementation\n@Component\npublic class LegacyUserServiceFacade implements UserServiceFacade {\n    @Autowired LegacyUserService legacy;\n    public UserDTO findById(String id) {\n        return UserMapper.toDTO(legacy.getUser(id));\n    }\n}\n\n// New implementation (Spring Boot)\n@Component\n@Primary\npublic class NewUserServiceFacade implements UserServiceFacade {\n    @Autowired UserRepository repo;\n    public UserDTO findById(String id) {\n        return repo.findById(id).map(UserMapper::toDTO).orElseThrow();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Feature Flags\n```yaml\n# application.yml\nmodernization:\n  auth-service: true\n  notification-service: true\n  reporting-service: false\n```\n\n## Data Migration (Dual-Write)\n```sql\n-- CDC trigger for User table\nCREATE TRIGGER user_cdc\nAFTER INSERT OR UPDATE ON users\nFOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION notify_user_change();\n```\n\n## Roadmap\n| Phase | Service | Weeks | Risk |\n|-------|---------|-------|------|\n| 1 | Auth | 4 | Low |\n| 2 | Notification | 3 | Low |\n| 3 | Reporting | 4 | Medium |\n| 4 | Core Domain | 12 | High |\n\n## Rollback\n- Feature flag flip: instant\n- Database: point-in-time recovery (RDS)\n- Blue-green deploy: DNS switch"
      }
    ],
